    "总览与详细笔记已完成。请优先检查最终决策及其原文依据。":"Overview and detailed notes are ready. Check final decisions and their source evidence first.",
    "进度连接暂时中断，正在重连；不会重复提交模型请求。":"Progress connection lost. Reconnecting without resubmitting model requests.", "AI 整理正在进行，请勿重复提交。":"AI processing is running; do not resubmit.",
    "请先生成或记录详细笔记，再补生成总览。":"Create detailed notes before generating an overview.",
    "重新生成将替换当前详细笔记及总览，旧版本会保留在 JSON 导出的 note_history 中。是否继续？":"Regeneration replaces current notes and the overview. Previous versions remain in note_history in JSON exports. Continue?",
    "本次包含全局综合：逐批整理后再次检查全篇重点与最终决策；长材料可能分层综合，最多额外 64 次请求，可能增加 token 与费用。不会自动重试失败请求。继续吗？":"This operation includes global synthesis after batch notes. Long material may need hierarchical synthesis, up to 64 extra requests, with additional tokens and costs. Failed requests are not automatically retried. Continue?",
    "正在启动整理…":"Starting processing…",
    "可添加 M4A、MP3、WAV 等音频，也支持 iPhone QTA / QuickTime 录音；保留原文件，不自动上传云端。":"Add M4A, MP3, WAV and other audio, including iPhone QTA / QuickTime recordings. Originals are preserved; no automatic cloud uploads.",
    "QuickTime 原件已保留。本地转写与听课版使用第一条音轨，不还原空间效果或额外音层。若浏览器不能直接播放，可本机生成听课版，或从语音备忘录重新导出 M4A。":"The QuickTime original is preserved. Local transcription and listening versions use the first audio track, not spatial effects or additional layers. If your browser cannot play it directly, generate a local listening version or re-export M4A from Voice Memos.",
    "浏览器无法直接播放这份 QuickTime 录音。原件已保存，可用本地 FFmpeg 生成听课版，或在语音备忘录中重新导出 M4A；不要只修改后缀。":"This browser cannot play the QuickTime recording directly. The original is saved. Generate a local listening version with FFmpeg or re-export M4A from Voice Memos; renaming the extension is not a conversion.",
