    "降噪听课版可能改变音色；未裁剪或变速，可切回原音。Whisper 使用原录音，试听选择不会改变转写输入。":"Denoising may change the voice. The timeline and speed are unchanged. Switch back at any time; listening versions do not change whole-file transcription input.",
