    "密钥只保存于受限的本机配置文件，不会显示已有值，也不会写入浏览器存储。配置接口不等于连接成功；每次发送课堂材料前仍会单独询问。":"Keys are kept only in the private local settings file, never returned or stored in browser storage. Configuration does not prove connectivity; each external send needs consent.", "检查已保存的本地环境":"Check saved local setup", "本地 Whisper · 可选":"Local Whisper · Optional", "复用已有 MLX Whisper 环境，主要面向 Apple Silicon Mac。此处不安装依赖、不下载权重；其他平台可导入外部文字稿或使用网关。":"Use an existing MLX Whisper setup on Apple Silicon Mac. This screen does not install packages or download weights. Other platforms can import transcripts or use a gateway.", "Python 可执行文件":"Python executable", "选择安装了 mlx-whisper 的 python3。留空使用启动 App 的 Python。":"Choose the python3 with mlx-whisper installed. Leave blank to use the app's Python.", "本地模型目录":"Local model directory", "须含 config.json 与 npz / safetensors 权重。路径仅本机使用，请不要公开设置截图。":"Must contain config.json and npz / safetensors weights. Paths are local and may be private; do not publish settings screenshots.", "主要语言":"Default recording language", "自动识别不保证短句内混合外语的准确率；哲学术语仍需核对。":"Auto-detection does not guarantee accuracy within code-switched sentences. Check specialist terms.",
